  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To a medium saucepan, add the water and bring to the boil. • Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. • Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. • Stir through the butter. Cover to keep warm. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don&#39;t peek!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f879374264524ca97a57dd/step-62bea000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While rice is cooking, roughly chop Asian greens. • Slice zucchini into half-moons.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f879374264524ca97a57dd/step-4f62f710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. • Cook zucchini, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f879374264524ca97a57dd/step-271bd320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook plant-based chicken strips and mild North Indian spice blend, tossing, until browned, 4-5 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f879374264524ca97a57dd/step-429e1a30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add mild curry paste, coconut milk, the brown sugar, Asian greens and return cooked zucchini to the pan and cook stirring, until thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f879374264524ca97a57dd/step-8d8ac140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide rice between bowls. • Top with plant-based chicken and veggie korma curry. • Sprinkle over flaked almonds and dollop over Greek-Style yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f879374264524ca97a57dd/step-6c667850.jpg"
    }
  ]
